# 
# http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I2_Belief
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I2_Belief> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I2_Belief> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I2_Belief> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Assertion"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I2_Belief> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://schema.org/Claim> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I2_Belief> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A provenance-bearing belief or claim about a heritage entity or event. The assertion is represented as CRMinf I2 Belief and as a prov:Entity, allowing source, attribution, generation time, revision, confidence, and reconciliation status to be recorded explicitly."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I2_Belief> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/schema> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I2_Belief> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#relatedMatch> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I2_Belief> <https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/crminf_pattern> "I2_Belief -J4_that-> I4_Proposition_Set; evidence via I5_Inference_Making (J1_used_as_premise / J2_concluded_that); expert re-check via I7_Belief_Adoption" .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
