<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/KumariTenure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Living Goddess Tenure"@en .
<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/KumariTenure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broadMatch> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E4_Period> .
<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/KumariTenure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Time-bounded role where a person embodies a deity as Living Goddess (Kumari), residing at a specific god-house and supported by religious institutions. This class captures the unique Nepali tradition of living deity embodiment in young girls selected from Buddhist Shakya/Vajracharya families."@en .
<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/KumariTenure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/schema> .
